=2 Walkthrough
__You must zone after completing the previous quest.__
* While your main job is {p:Summoner}, interact with the **House of the Hero** in {z:Windurst Walls} for a cutscene with {p:Carbuncle}. He will give you a {@k} {k:Carbuncle's Tear}.
* Speak to {p:Koru-Moru} in {z:Windurst Walls} at (E-7). He will ask for four {p:Astragaloi|Astragalos}.
** Astragalos may be purchased at the Bonecrafting Guild in {z:Windurst Woods} from {n:Shih Tayuun}, but is only restocked if players NPC it to the guild.
* Trade {p:Koru-Moru} x4 {p:Astragalos}.
* He will task you to speak to the following three NPCs in any order:
** {n:Fuepepe} at the east **Aurastery** building in {z:Windurst Waters} (North) (L-6).
*** Fuepepe may need to be spoken to several times, and repeat the same non-quest related text before giving you the correct text to continue the quest.
** {n:Furakku-Norakku} at the east **Opistery** building in {z:Windurst Waters} (North) (G-8).
** {p:Shantotto} at her manor in {z:Windurst Walls} (K-7).
*** Shantotto could start off {q:several|Blood and Glory|several} {q:quests|Curses, Foiled A-Golem!?|quests}. Talk to her until she mentions Sunny-Pabonny.
* Speak to {n:Gulmama} in {z:Northern San d'Oria} at (E-7) to receive an {i:Ice Pendulum|Ice Pendulum|1171}.
* Head to the {z:Cloister of Frost} in {z:Fei'Yin}. The closest {p:Home Point} is #2.
** If this is your first time visiting {z:Cloister of Frost}, follow these directions:
*** Enter {z:Fei'Yin} via {z:Beaucedine Glacier} at (J-4). If you do not want to walk, you can use the {p:Unity} warp.
*** Using the maps below (click to enlarge), navigate to (G-9) on map 1 to walk downstairs.
*** Zone into the {z:Cloister of Frost} at (I-5) on map 2.

!Fei'Yin-map1.jpg||Fei'Yin map 1
!Fei'Yin-map2.jpg||Fei'Yin map 2
* Trade the {i:Ice Pendulum|Ice Pendulum|1171} to the Protocrystal to enter a battlefield.
** The battle will be against 6 {m:Dryads|Dryad}.
*** Trust Alter-Egos are allowed in this battlefield.
*** If you are a lower level {p:Summoner} it may be difficult to solo this fight. All six monsters have shared hate.
* Defeat them and then speak to {p:Koru-Moru} to complete the quest and receive your reward.
** You can toss the {i:Ice Pendulum|Ice Pendulum|1171} after completing the quest, as it serves no further purpose.

